#COMPONENTPREFIX CWWKO
#COMPONENTNAMEFOR CWWKO WebSphere kernel channel framework service: channel configuration
#CMVCPATHNAME io.openliberty.channel.config.common/resources/io/openliberty/channel/config/internal/resources/ChannelConfigMessages.nlsprops
#ISMESSAGEFILE TRUE
#NLS_ENCODING=UNICODE
#
# NLS_MESSAGEFORMAT_VAR
#
#   Strings in this file which contain replacement variables are processed by the MessageFormat 
#   class (single quote must be coded as 2 consecutive single quotes ''). Strings in this file 
#   which do NOT contain replacement variables are NOT processed by the MessageFormat class 
#   (single quote must be coded as one single quote '). 
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Message prefix block: CWWKO0400 - CWWKO0499

QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE=CWWKO0400I: The quiesceTimeout attribute on the server element overrides the chainQuiesceTimeout attribute. The server ignores the configured chainQuiesceTimeout value of {0} seconds.
# {0} is the number of seconds
QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE.explanation=When the quiesceTimeout attribute is configured on the server element in the server.xml file, the attribute takes precedence over the chainQuiesceTimeout attribute on the channelfw element. The server ignores the chainQuiesceTimeout value.
QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE.useraction=No action is required. If you want to use the chainQuiesceTimeout value, remove the quiesceTimeout attribute from the server element.